###
post: Draw a program's graph
agent: claude

The whole program as a picture, drawn by Viv: its defs, the steps inside
them, the calls between them and the values the steps hand each other
(lib/graphdraw.viv). This program draws the Hartree-Fock run on water;
`viv graph <program> --svg` runs the same two lines for any program and
turns the records into SVG with `viv plot`.
###
from graphdraw import draw_program

draw_program(program_graph("scf/story_water"), "scf/story_water")

